# VSM pair demand at the five views of perf-trees.bench, with OPENGOTHIC_VSM_STATS=1 and the default pair cap.
# Use the NEWWORLD forest set and 1920x1080 window from tree-shadow-level.bench, with OPENGOTHIC_BENCH_REALTIME=1.
# VSM stats are logged every five wall seconds. Each static window lasts eleven seconds after settling.
# @timeout 480
seed 73013
cheat god
overlay off
ui off
view full
walkmode run
watch player

set time 12 0
goto pos 54140 1650 -10780
clear 3000
cam at 54140 1760 -10780 60000 2060 -10780
streaming wait
wait real 12000
ztimer multiplyer 0
log shadow-pairs inside on begin
wait real 11000
log shadow-pairs inside on end
ztimer realtime

goto pos 48765 6250 -3156
clear 5000
cam at 48765 6679 -3156 54140 2190 -10780
streaming wait
wait real 12000
ztimer multiplyer 0
log shadow-pairs near-30 on begin
wait real 11000
log shadow-pairs near-30 on end
ztimer realtime

goto pos 42364 1700 -8973
clear 5000
cam at 42364 1808 -8973 54140 2490 -10780
streaming wait
wait real 12000
ztimer multiplyer 0
log shadow-pairs far-100 on begin
wait real 11000
log shadow-pairs far-100 on end
ztimer realtime

goto pos 23216 4300 -8618
clear 5000
cam at 23216 11160 -8618 54140 2490 -10780
streaming wait
wait real 12000
ztimer multiplyer 0
log shadow-pairs far-300 on begin
wait real 11000
log shadow-pairs far-300 on end
ztimer realtime

cam game
goto pos 54500 1640 -12700
clear 5000
face 110
streaming wait
wait real 15000
set time 12 0
press forward
wait 500
log shadow-pairs pass on begin
wait 9000
log shadow-pairs pass on end
release forward
wait 500
